# Provider code

Match the existing resources in `internal/provider`. HashiCorp Plugin Framework behavior is documented at https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/plugin/framework.

- New resources and data sources follow `.claude/skills/implement-terraform-provider-resource`.
- Shared string Set/List helpers belong in `internal/provider/utils.go`.
- Embedded descriptions are plain prose in `internal/provider/docs/`. The provider-docs rule attaches for those files.
